0..75 Comment "// A handler over a theory: the scope takes `State` as its interface, fixes"
76..150 Comment "// the stored sort `S` at `Integer` where it names the theory, and answers"
151..224 Comment "// each operation by a clause. The carrier `C` is what the scope answers;"
225..300 Comment "// `get` replies an integer to its continuation, and `put` sends one and is"
301..321 Comment "// replied the unit."
323..345 Comment "// The theory `State`."
